=2 Walkthrough
* Speak with {n:Ryoma} in {z:Norg} to begin the quest.
* Travel to (I-7) in {z:Yhoator Jungle}.

:* {p:Survival Guide} Teleportation ({p:Elshimo Uplands} > {z:Yhoator Jungle}) is the quickest way. You can find one east of {p:Home Point #1|Home Point} in {z:Norg}.
:* {p:Unity Warp} (Level 122) will teleport you at (J-7).

* Once prepared, examine the **???** at (I-7) (northwest of Bloodlet Spring) to spawn 3 {m:Sahagin} NMs.
* These mobs are:

:* {m:Kappa Akuso} (Monk)
:* {m:Kappa Biwa} (Bard)
:* {m:Kappa Bonze} (White Mage)

::* Only one needs to be killed, so zoning to {z:Den of Rancor} and fighting one while the others despawn is a recommended strategy.

* After the {m:Sahagin} are defeated, examine the **???** again to receive the {@k}{k:Old trick box}. You will not get the KI until the mobs fully despawn, including the corpses.
* Return to {n:Ryoma} for another cutscene.
* Head to {z:Rabao} and speak with {n:Leodarion} at (F-7) on the west side of the lake near the windmill.
* Go to {z:Kuftal Tunnel} and obtain a {i:Kuftal Coffer Key|Kuftal Coffer Key|1051}.
** Alternatively, you can purchase one from the {p:Curio Vendor Moogle}.

:* Fastest route's are {p:Survival Guide} Teleportation ({p:Vollbow} > {z:Kuftal Tunnel}) or {p:Unity Warp} (Level 125) to {z:Kuftal Tunnel}.

* Find and open the {p:Treasure Coffer} to obtain the {@k}{k:Large trick box}.
* Return to {n:Leodarion} to complete the quest.

